[[Flowstone Elemental]]s are dangerous [[Fire Magic|fire]] [[elementalist]]s found beneath the surface of Tyria in [[dungeon]]s and in [[explorable area]]s, often in or around fiery environments.  Their name is most likely a reference to [[W:Flowstone|flowstone]], a mineral formation found in caves, though they bear little resemblance to it.

