==Notes==
*Flowstone Elementals deal large amounts of [[area of effect|AoE]] damage, so it is important to spread out when facing them. Avoid fighting more than one simultaneously, if possible. They can often be seen in the same areas as [[Burning Spirit]]s, so be particularly cautious if the two intermingle.
*This creature has a [[miniature]] [[Miniature Flowstone Elemental|version]].
